'''''Glory, Turn From Imbibed Poison''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Light Slips the Gate, Shadow Greets the Throne]].

==Steps==
# Speak with Tribbie
# Head to the hot bath and look for the Kremnoans
# Speak to the playing children
# Look for Krateros
# Follow Krateros to a quiet corner...
# ...Prepare to strike

